# Compiled class file
*.class

# Log file
*.log

# BlueJ files
*.ctxt

# Mobile Tools for Java (J2ME)
.mtj.tmp/

# Package Files #
*.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

# Gradle wrapper jar must stay tracked despite *.jar above (CI relies on ./gradlew).
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# Gradle / build artifacts — must never be committed.
.gradle/
build/
.kotlin/

# virtual machine crash logs, see http://www.java.com/en/download/help/error_hotspot.xml
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# Per-machine tool settings — never tracked (workspace working-rules § Records).
/.claude/

# Private machine facts (paths, environment) — never committed.
/cmem/local/

# Open review issues stay local (review standard § 10, letter H37); checked by scripts/check-privacy.main.kts.
/cmem/review-issues.md

# The root CLAUDE.md is an untracked pointer to cmem/STATE.md and cmem/INDEX.md (memory guide, letter H38).
/CLAUDE.md
